      "**Morally uneasy** — amazed by Jesus's silence (Mark 15:5); warned by his wife's dream (Matt 27:19); tried to release him (John 19:12)",
      "**Ultimately weak** — \"wishing to satisfy the crowd\" (Mark 15:15); the man with the power who surrendered it"
